大臣記者会見概要を公開しました。\n令和8年版自殺対策白書について\n与党の社会保障改革協議の再開について\n連合「2027春季生活闘争基本構想」について\nPHPの脆弱性に関する厚生労働省関係サイト等への影響等について\n生活保護受給者の自動車保有の在り方について\nhttps://t.co/vsD1NdZU5N","id_str":"2113562092049678413","is_quote_status":false,"lang":"ja","possibly_sensitive":false,"possibly_sensitive_editable":true,"quote_count":6,"reply_count":78,"retweet_count":18,"retweeted":false,"user_id_str":"180585090"},"rest_id":"2113562092049678413","unmention_data":{},"views":{"count":"30300","state":"EnabledWithCount"}}}}},"entryId":"tweet-2113562092049678413","sortIndex":"2114525190858735564"},{"content":{"__typename":"TimelineTimelineItem","clientEventInfo":{"component":"suggest_organic_list_tweet","details":{"timelinesDetails":{"injectionType":"OrganicListTweet"}},"element":"tweet"},"entryType":"TimelineTimelineItem","itemContent":{"__typename":"TimelineTweet","itemType":"TimelineTweet","tweetDisplayType":"Tweet","tweet_results":{"result":{"__typename":"Tweet","cashtag_attachments":[],"core":{"user_results":{"result":{"__typename":"User","action_counts":{"favorites_count":46},"affiliates_highlighted_label":{},"avatar":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1985639760669655041/3yz_lJbK_normal.jpg"},"banner":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/218434058/1790225212"},"core":{"created_at":"Mon Nov 22 10:18:33 +0000 2010","name":"高市早苗","screen_name":"takaichi_sanae"},"dm_permissions":{"can_dm":false},"follow_request_sent":false,"has_graduated_access":true,"id":"VXNlcjoyMTg0MzQwNTg=","is_blue_verified":true,"location":{"location":""},"media_permissions":{"can_media_tag":true},"notifications_settings":{"notifications_enabled":false},"parody_commentary_fan_label":"None","pinned_items":{},"possibly_sensitive":false,"privacy":{"protected":false},"profile_bio":{"description":"衆議院議員 自由民主党奈良県第2選挙区支部長\n※総理在任中の投稿は、一部広報スタッフによるものを含みます。","entities":{"description":{},"url":{"urls":[{"display_url":"sanae.gr.jp","expanded_url":"https://www.sanae.gr.jp/","indices":[0,23],"url":"https://t.co/VNedKNdzy0"}]}}},"profile_description_language":"ja","profile_image_shape":"Circle","profile_metadata":{"profile_interstitial_type":""},"profile_translation":{"translator_type":"none"},"relationship_counts":{"followers":3069213,"following":0},"relationship_perspectives":{"blocked_by":false,"blocking":false,"followed_by":false,"following":false,"live_following":false,"muting":false},"rest_id":"218434058","super_follow_eligible":false,"super_followed_by":false,"super_following":false,"tweet_counts":{"media_tweets":596,"tweets":1899},"verification":{"verified":false,"verified_type":"Government"},"website":{"url":"https://t.co/VNedKNdzy0"}}}},"edit_control":{"edit_tweet_ids":["2113560728846389547"],"editable_until_msecs":"1792750720000","edits_remaining":"5","is_edit_eligible":true},"grok_analysis_button":true,"grok_annotations":{"is_image_editable_by_grok":false},"grok_translated_post_with_availability":{"is_available":false},"is_translatable":false,"legacy":{"bookmark_count":433,"bookmarked":false,"conversation_id_str":"2113560728846389547","created_at":"Fri Oct 23 09:18:40 +0000 2026","display_text_range":[0,90],"entities":{},"favorite_count":21210,"favorited":false,"full_text":"先月の台風25号の被害により、運転見合わせが続いている「内房線（姉ヶ崎駅～長浦駅）」について、本日、JR東日本が、「11月9日（月）から運転再開する見通し」になったと発表しました。","id_str":"2113560728846389547","is_quote_status":false,"lang":"ja","quote_count":282,"reply_count":504,"retweet_count":2956,"retweeted":false,"user_id_str":"218434058"},"note_tweet":{"is_expandable":true,"note_tweet_results":{"result":{"entity_set":{"hashtags":[],"smarttags":[],"symbols":[],"urls":[],"user_mentions":[]},"id":"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIxMTM1NjA3Mjg3ODc2MTk4NDA=","richtext":{"richtext_tags":[]},"text":"先月の台風25号の被害により、運転見合わせが続いている「内房線（姉ヶ崎駅～長浦駅）」について、本日、JR東日本が、「11月9日（月）から運転再開する見通し」になったと発表しました。\n\n当初は、JR東日本によって、隣接する県道や崩れた斜面の復旧も「鉄道事業者」が行う前提で「少なくとも3か月程度」かかると見込まれていました。\nその後の調整により、千葉県が「道路管理者」として対象の県道や斜面の復旧作業を「優先的」に進めた結果、JRが行う鉄道復旧工事についても迅速化が図られ、「約1か月半」での再開見通しに至りました。\n\n関係者による円滑な連携・協力とご努力に改めて敬意を表します。\n\n11月9日に向け工事が順調に進み、運転再開を無事に迎えられますことを心待ちに致します。"}}},"rest_id":"2113560728846389547","unmention_data":{},"views":{"count":"972116","state":"EnabledWithCount"}}}}},"entryId":"tweet-2113560728846389547","sortIndex":"2114525190858735563"},{"content":{"__typename":"TimelineTimelineItem","clientEventInfo":{"component":"suggest_organic_list_tweet","details":{"timelinesDetails":{"injectionType":"OrganicListTweet"}},"element":"tweet"},"entryType":"TimelineTimelineItem","itemContent":{"__typename":"TimelineTweet","itemType":"TimelineTweet","tweetDisplayType":"Tweet","tweet_results":{"result":{"__typename":"Tweet","cashtag_attachments":[],"core":{"user_results":{"result":{"__typename":"User","action_counts":{"favorites_count":2},"affiliates_highlighted_label":{},"avatar":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1595652744500908032/vw4r2sfI_normal.jpg"},"banner":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/242156036/1412822664"},"core":{"created_at":"Mon Jan 24 02:43:14 +0000 2011","name":"文部科学省　MEXT","screen_name":"mextjapan"},"dm_permissions":{"can_dm":false},"follow_request_sent":false,"has_graduated_access":true,"id":"VXNlcjoyNDIxNTYwMzY=","is_blue_verified":false,"location":{"location":"東京都千代田区霞が関"},"media_permissions":{"can_media_tag":true},"notifications_settings":{"notifications_enabled":false},"parody_commentary_fan_label":"None","pinned_items":{"tweet_ids_str":["2082314655360504287"]},"possibly_sensitive":false,"privacy":{"protected":false},"profile_bio":{"description":"文部科学省の公式アカウントです。\n教育、科学技術・学術、スポーツ、文化に関する情報を広く発信していきます。\nMinistry of Education, Culture, Sports, Science and Technology（MEXT）\n公式サイト：https://t.co/O94D1M8l91","entities":{"description":{"urls":[{"display_url":"mext.go.jp","expanded_url":"https://www.mext.go.jp/","indices":[129,152],"url":"https://t.co/O94D1M8l91"}]},"url":{"urls":[{"display_url":"mext.go.jp/social/index.h…","expanded_url":"https://www.mext.go.jp/social/index.htm","indices":[0,23],"url":"https://t.co/Pln4zCyK96"}]}}},"profile_d