ドイツとは、基本的価値を共有し、G7などで国際社会の問題に対し協調して取り組む重要なパートナーとして、今後も二国間の防衛協力・交流をさらに推進していきます。"}}},"rest_id":"2113529755379347492","unmention_data":{},"views":{"count":"31575","state":"EnabledWithCount"}}}}},"entryId":"tweet-2113529755379347492","sortIndex":"2114525190858735538"},{"content":{"__typename":"TimelineTimelineItem","clientEventInfo":{"component":"suggest_organic_list_tweet","details":{"timelinesDetails":{"injectionType":"OrganicListTweet"}},"element":"tweet"},"entryType":"TimelineTimelineItem","itemContent":{"__typename":"TimelineTweet","itemType":"TimelineTweet","tweetDisplayType":"Tweet","tweet_results":{"result":{"__typename":"Tweet","card":{"legacy":{"binding_values":[{"key":"photo_image_full_size_large","value":{"image_value":{"height":419,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2113527452618334208/tqzm5mFx?format=jpg&name=800x419","width":800},"type":"IMAGE"}},{"key":"thumbnail_image","value":{"image_value":{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2113527452618334208/tqzm5mFx?format=jpg&name=280x150","width":267},"type":"IMAGE"}},{"key":"description","value":{"string_value":"令和8年10月23日、城内大臣が記者会見を行いました。会見要旨は後日掲載します。［冒頭発言］駐日EU次期大使大臣表敬、経済財政諮問会議資料英訳［質疑応答］基調的な物価上昇率","type":"STRING"}},{"key":"domain","value":{"string_value":"www.gov-online.go.jp","type":"STRING"}},{"key":"thumbnail_image_large","value":{"image_value":{"height":320,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2113527452618334208/tqzm5mFx?format=jpg&name=800x320_1","width":569},"type":"IMAGE"}},{"key":"summary_photo_image_small","value":{"image_value":{"height":202,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2113527452618334208/tqzm5mFx?format=jpg&name=386x202","width":386},"type":"IMAGE"}},{"key":"thumbnail_image_original","value":{"image_value":{"height":720,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2113527452618334208/tqzm5mFx?format=jpg&name=orig","width":1280},"type":"IMAGE"}},{"key":"site","value":{"scribe_key":"publisher_id","type":"USER","user_value":{"id_str":"461064204","path":[]}}},{"key":"photo_image_